  "prefLabel": "Emp 101.15 Week",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 101.15 “Week” means the 7 consecutive calendar days beginning at 12:01 A.M. Sunday and ending at 12:00 midnight on the next succeeding Saturday, unless otherwise specifically defined in RSA 282-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Emp 100) #10080, eff 1-30-12; renumbered by #10193, INTERIM (from Emp 101.08)",
